		turret spread to base to along
		sketch along 0 base at heading 12 14 4 sketch-box
		along 0 > if 1 else -1 then to forward
		[ -2 2 ] ( across |
			sketch [ along forward 7 * + across base 2 + at along forward 23 * + across base 2.5 + at ] sketch-path
		) each
	) each
